  "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EWhat you can see here\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eexample pages for common GOV.UK components, such as forms, warning text and summary lists\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epages that were written and published by an AI assistant\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EHow pages are updated\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EContent editors change pages in Umbraco. They can also ask an AI assistant to make changes for them.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant can only edit and publish pages on this site. It cannot delete pages or change how the site works.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWho to contact\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you have a question about this prototype, email the prototype team at prototype-team@example.com.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe aim to reply within 2 working days.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </bodyText>
    <insetText>
      <Value><![CDATA[This is a local prototype. It is not a real government service.]]></Value>
    </insetText>
    <lede>
      <Value><![CDATA[This is a test website. It shows how a team could build and update GOV.UK-style pages using a content management system called Umbraco.]]></Value>
    </lede>
    <pageHeading>
      <Value><![CDATA[About this prototype]]></Value>
    </pageHeading>
